raint\":{\"left\":{\"collection\":\"uXKM700G7\",\"name\":\"JZIcueURj\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},\"operator\":\"==\",\"right\":{\"collection\":\"JZIcueURj\",\"name\":\"id\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},\"type\":\"BinaryOperation\"},\"left\":\"5116202b-38c3-44fb-9d18-3fd2a2fdaaef\",\"right\":\"392d2226-97e6-4e5f-8fee-eabe39e2e742\",\"type\":\"LeftJoin\"},\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"uXKM700G7\",\"name\":\"AJGkEUJIB\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"uXKM700G7\",\"name\":\"iHxiqFeuz\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"alias\":\"JZIcueURj.Rp0IUWHT6\",\"collection\":\"JZIcueURj\",\"name\":\"Rp0IUWHT6\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"alias\":\"JZIcueURj.n926JXy_W\",\"collection\":\"JZIcueURj\",\"name\":\"n926JXy_W\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"alias\":\"JZIcueURj.iIKCazp1d\",\"collection\":\"JZIcueURj\",\"name\":\"iIKCazp1d\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"uXKM700G7\",\"name\":\"inwSrFWMI\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"uXKM700G7\",\"name\":\"cZEW3XBBr\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"}],\"where\":{\"type\":\"BinaryOperation\",\"operator\":\"==\",\"left\":{\"type\":\"TypeCast\",\"value\":{\"type\":\"Identifier\",\"name\":\"iyYBJMVbq\",\"collection\":\"uXKM700G7\"},\"dataType\":\"STRING\"},\"right\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":\"your-tools-already-talk.-you-don-t-have-to.\"}}}default",[4],{"AJGkEUJIB":5,"iHxiqFeuz":8,"JZIcueURj.Rp0IUWHT6":15,"JZIcueURj.n926JXy_W":17,"JZIcueURj.iIKCazp1d":23,"inwSrFWMI":25,"cZEW3XBBr":28},{"type":6,"value":7},"string","Your Tools Already Talk. You Don't Have To.",{"type":9,"value":10},"responsiveimage",{"src":11,"srcSet":12,"pixelWidth":13,"pixelHeight":14},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/WZnkJ0N8GjD8YGH73bVRdcc9tvI.png?width=960&height=1200","https://framerusercontent.com/images/WZnkJ0N8GjD8YGH73bVRdcc9tvI.png?scale-down-to=1024&width=960&height=1200 819w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/WZnkJ0N8GjD8YGH73bVRdcc9tvI.png?width=960&height=1200 960w",960,1200,{"type":6,"value":16},"Marcus Elliot",{"type":9,"value":18},{"src":19,"srcSet":20,"pixelWidth":21,"pixelHeight":21,"alt":22},"https://framerusercontent.com/images/LT8btWGzlVT8iH26EzODSoZ6OE.png?width=1024&height=1024","https://framerusercontent.com/images/LT8btWGzlVT8iH26EzODSoZ6OE.png?scale-down-to=512&width=1024&height=1024 512w,https://framerusercontent.com/images/LT8btWGzlVT8iH26EzODSoZ6OE.png?width=1024&height=1024 1024w",1024,"Team Image",{"type":6,"value":24},"AI Strategy Lead",{"type":26,"value":27},"date","2026-06-24T00:00:00.000Z",{"type":29,"value":30},"richtext",{"collectionId":31,"pointer":32},"5116202b-38c3-44fb-9d18-3fd2a2fdaaefdefault","[1,[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"When people picture automation, they usually picture a single task getting faster. But sit with a team for a day and you'll notice the real drain isn't the tasks themselves. It's the spaces between them, the moment someone copies a number out of one tool and pastes it into another, then pings a colleague to say it's ready.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Those handoffs feel small. Each one takes a minute. But they happen dozens of times a day, across every team, and they're where work quietly slows down.\"]],[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Follow the copy-paste\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The fastest way to find these gaps is to watch for copying. Every time information moves from one system to another by hand, there's a handoff that could run on its own. A lead fills in a form, and someone retypes it into the CRM. A deal closes, and someone updates the finance sheet. An order ships, and someone messages support to keep them in the loop.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"None of these are hard problems. The tools involved almost always have a way to talk to each other already. The person in the middle is just acting as the messenger.\"]],[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Connect the path, not just the steps\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The trick is to map the whole path before you automate any single piece. Where does this information start, where does it need to end up, and who touches it along the way? Once you can see the full route, you can connect it end to end, so the lead flows from form to CRM to the right rep without anyone lifting a finger.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"This is also where reliability matters most. A handoff that runs automatically needs to handle the messy cases too, the duplicate entry, the missing field, the occasional exception. Good automation doesn't just move the happy path. It knows what to do when something looks off.\"]],[4,\"h3\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Get out of the middle\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"The goal isn't to make your team type faster. It's to take them out of the middle entirely, so they spend their time on the work that actually needs a human, not on shuttling data between screens.\"]],[4,\"p\",{\"dir\":\"auto\"},[5,\"Your tools were built to connect. The hours disappear when a person has to do the connecting by hand. Close those gaps and the day gets noticeably quieter.\"]]]","{\"from\":{\"constraint\":{\"left\":{\"collection\":\"BP6L8Ne2f\",\"name\":\"s9RdlreXh\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},\"operator\":\"==\",\"right\":{\"collection\":\"s9RdlreXh\",\"name\":\"id\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},\"type\":\"BinaryOperation\"},\"left\":\"5116202b-38c3-44fb-9d18-3fd2a2fdaaef\",\"right\":\"16665cff-c5e6-43c2-9762-3455f788f230\",\"type\":\"LeftJoin\"},\"limit\":{\"type\":\"LiteralValue\",\"value\":3},\"select\":[{\"collection\":\"BP6L8Ne2f\",\"name\":\"iyYBJMVbq\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"BP6L8Ne2f\",\"name\":\"AJGkEUJIB\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"BP6L8Ne2f\",\"name\":\"iHxiqFeuz\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"alias\":\"s9RdlreXh.qXDFxOi5A\",\"collection\":\"s9RdlreXh\",\"name\":\"qXDFxOi5A\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"BP6L8Ne2f\",\"name\":\"inwSrFWMI\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"},{\"collection\":\"BP6L8Ne2f\",\"name\":\"id\",\"type\":\"Identifier\"}],\"where\":{\"